# A Fate Decided (CoP 8-2) played through. A level 75 Warrior of San d'Oria with 8-2 current (a GM; Status 0) in the
# Grand Palace of Hu'Xzoi. _iyq at Status 0, Ixghrah not up: Ixghrah spawned and claimed, PRESENCE_HAS_DRAWN (7375);
# again while he is up: NOTHING_LEFT_TO_DO (7378, the zone's default). His death at Status 0: Status 1. _iyq at Status
# 1: 3; finished: the mission completes (When Angels Fall current).
lists GrandPalaceOfHuxzoi/_iya/onTrigger GrandPalaceOfHuxzoi/_iyq/onTrigger GrandPalaceOfHuxzoi/onEventFinish/3
char zone=GrandPalaceOfHuxzoi pos=420,-1,396 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop AFateDecided current
login
trigger _iyq                            # Status 0: Ixghrah spawned, 7375
trigger _iyq                            # he is up: 7378 (the default)
kill IXGHRAH                            # Status 1
trigger _iyq                            # Status 1: 3
finish                                  # completed
